ss":244,"line":258},[242,587,588],{"class":577},"  --mobile-preset",[242,590,591],{"class":577}," low-ram\n",[223,593,594,595,502,598,601,602,605,606,609],{},"Accepted values are ",[239,596,597],{},"low-ram",[239,599,600],{},"balanced",", and ",[239,603,604],{},"gpu-max"," (the clap\n",[239,607,608],{},"value_parser"," rejects unknown strings at startup).",[227,611,613],{"id":612},"practical-defaults","Practical defaults",[223,615,616],{},"For a first mobile test:",[447,618,619,626,633,636,643],{},[450,620,621,622,625],{},"Start with a small ",[239,623,624],{},"Q4_K_M"," or smaller quantized GGUF.",[450,627,628,629,632],{},"Use ",[239,630,631],{},"n_ctx = 2048"," until prompts require more.",[450,634,635],{},"Keep batch sizes conservative.",[450,637,638,639,642],{},"Prefer memory mapping when the platform supports it\n(",[239,640,641],{},"LlamaParams::with_use_mmap(true)"," is the default in the presets).",[450,644,645],{},"Add GPU offload only after CPU-only load and generation work.",[227,647,649],{"id":648},"multimodal-on-mobile","Multimodal on mobile",[223,651,652],{},"Vision models need both the text GGUF and projector file, and image\ntokens add context pressure. Start the server with the matching projector:",[232,654,656],{"className":557,"code":655,"filename":559,"language":560,"meta":237,"style":237},"llama-crab-server \\\n  --model models\u002FLFM2.5-VL-1.6B-Q4_K_M.gguf \\\n  --mmproj models\u002Fmmproj.gguf \\\n  --mobile-preset low-ram\n",[239,657,658,664,673,683],{"__ignoreMap":237},[242,659,660,662],{"class":244,"line":245},[242,661,568],{"class":567},[242,663,572],{"class":571},[242,665,666,668,671],{"class":244,"line":251},[242,667,578],{"class":577},[242,669,670],{"class":577}," models\u002FLFM2.5-VL-1.6B-Q4_K_M.gguf",[242,672,572],{"class":571},[242,674,675,678,681],{"class":244,"line":258},[242,676,677],{"class":577},"  --mmproj",[242,679,680],{"class":577}," models\u002Fmmproj.gguf",[242,682,572],{"class":571},[242,684,685,687],{"class":244,"line":264},[242,686,588],{"class":577},[242,688,591],{"class":577},[223,690,691,692,695,696,699,700,703,704,706],{},"The server's ",[239,693,694],{},"mtmd"," cargo feature must be enabled at build time\n(",[239,697,698],{},"cargo install llama-crab-server --features mtmd --force","). The\n",[239,701,702],{},"tauri-plugin-llama-crab"," plugin enables its own ",[239,705,694],{}," feature\nindependently, so mobile\u002Fdesktop apps can ship multimodal chat without\nthe HTTP server.",[223,708,709,710,713],{},"For app integration, validate one image size and one prompt shape first,\nthen increase context or image complexity only when needed. The\nTypeScript client and the Tauri plugin both accept ",[239,711,712],{},"data:image\u002F...;base64,...","\nURLs and local file paths for image content parts.",[715,716,717],"style",{},"html .light .shiki span {color: var(--shiki-light);background: var(--shiki-light-bg);font-style: var(--shiki-light-font-style);font-weight: var(--shiki-light-font-weight);text-decoration: var(--shiki-light-text-decoration);}html.light .shiki span {color: var(--shiki-light);background: var(--shiki-light-bg);font-style: var(--shiki-light-font-style);font-weight: var(--shiki-light-font-weight);text-decoration: var(--shiki-light-text-decoration);}html .default .shiki span {color: var(--shiki-default);background: var(--shiki-default-bg);font-style: var(--shiki-default-font-style);font-weight: var(--shiki-default-font-weight);text-decoration: var(--shiki-default-text-decoration);}html .shiki span {color: var(--shiki-default);background: var(--shiki-default-bg);font-style: var(--shiki-default-font-style);font-weight: var(--shiki-default-font-weight);text-decoration: var(--shiki-default-text-decoration);}html .dark .shiki span {color: var(--shiki-dark);background: var(--shiki-dark-bg);font-style: var(--shiki-dark-font-style);font-weight: var(--shiki-dark-font-weight);text-decoration: var(--shiki-dark-text-decoration);}html.dark .shiki span {color: var(--shiki-